From: RX5950XT <123271969+RX5950XT@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:51:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fix: rebuild CUDA kernels when arch changes


diff --git a/crates/kernels/build.rs b/crates/kernels/build.rs
index 7930ffd..0a7f494 100644
--- a/crates/kernels/build.rs
+++ b/crates/kernels/build.rs
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@ fn main() {
         return;
     }
     println!("cargo:rerun-if-changed=cuda");
+    println!("cargo:rerun-if-env-changed=PULSAR_CUDA_ARCH");
     // One fatbin for every NVIDIA generation the kernels can serve. The
     // floor is dp4a = sm_61 (Pascal / GTX 10-series); nothing newer is
     // required (no tensor cores, no async-copy, static <=48KB shared).
-- 
